    description: "tranche-05 chunk-1 (pass 82 / F82.A5; preserved per operator). Of 10294 write-tagged edges, top dst names are Symbol/LinkerContext (instantiates/ast_new constructor calls) and append/add/extend collection mutations — dataflow-write-position conflated with I/O-write semantics. Direct-I/O counter-positive verified. Reproduced fresh. RELATED to INV-kudug (read-ops-as-write) but a distinct facet: write-position vs I/O-write, not read-as-write. Evidence: agent_notes + dogfood_tranche_05/pass_82.md."  # 1492
